WEBVTT

00:01:56.246 --> 00:02:00.038
And it's been hard for you not to know
what you're doing next month or July

00:02:00.038 --> 00:02:02.621
or August. How are you managing
your schedule?

00:02:02.788 --> 00:02:06.704
And I'm mostly asking this for
my own sake to really get

00:02:06.704 --> 00:02:08.163
a sense of how you're managing.

00:02:08.746 --> 00:02:11.496
It's really interesting,
isn't I mean, for me,

00:02:11.913 --> 00:02:18.163
I realized that planning has always made
me feel safe and it's always been

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:20.829
for me the vehicle of my ambitions.

00:02:21.746 --> 00:02:26.121
What I mean by that is that setting
intentions has always been really

00:02:26.121 --> 00:02:28.996
important for me in terms of
like if I'm in a place,

00:02:28.996 --> 00:02:31.871
whether it be emotionally or
professionally or financially,